            "block_content": "1. A layoff is an involuntary separation of a non-probationary career employee from employment or an involuntary transfer to a casual position of a career employee. For the purposes of this Article, layoff shall include involuntary reductions in regularly scheduled hours of work. Layoffs may be temporary or indefinite.",
